Speedrun Mode</strong> and <strong>Boss Rush</strong>: Special challenges that will test your mastery of <i>CODE Bunny</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303780/extras/a4dce4aa9bae2f6f4eb7c3f89dc68f25.poster.avif?t=1759243403\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303780/extras/a4dce4aa9bae2f6f4eb7c3f89dc68f25.webm?t=1759243403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303780/extras/a4dce4aa9bae2f6f4eb7c3f89dc68f25.mp4?t=1759243403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong> takes you to every stage in the game back to back! An in-game clock will record your best time. Try to compete with your friends to find out who\u2019s the fastest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush</strong> will take you to an <strong>alternate reality </strong>with a story diverging from <i>CODE Bunny</i>\u2019s main narrative. Fight all bosses in the game back to back, and face an even more daunting challenge afterwards...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get <strong>special gameplay rewards</strong> for beating the Extra Modes!</i></p>","developers":["Team Seventh Star"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303780/header.jpg?t=1759243403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommen